scenario: VOICE-SPK-01
title: Read aloud and system sounds
area: Voice
rows: F-VOICE-17, F-VOICE-19, F-VOICE-20
machines: any
needs: person
prereq: Speakers or headphones are working (see the sound checks).
step: Open the VOICE tile, READ ALOUD, type a short sentence and press Read.
expect: The sentence is read aloud in a clear voice, and the word being said is marked on screen.
clause: F-VOICE-17.read
step: Press Stop while a longer text is being read.
expect: The voice stops at once.
clause: F-VOICE-17.stop
step: Sign out and sign in again.
expect: You hear two soft falling notes at sign-out and two soft rising notes at sign-in.
clause: F-VOICE-19.login-logout
step: Make a notification arrive (finish a short job, or use the Bell test in Settings).
expect: A short notification sound plays once, not repeated.
clause: F-VOICE-19.notify
